{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1159.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"e4d5621940fb44a6914a75a243ccfb56f844feedca87b1e6f427ee800501c779","ja":"はい。噂にたがわぬ名湯……亜美も\n駆けつけた甲斐があったのではありませんか？","zh":"是的。果然名不虚传的名泉……亚美特地\n赶过来，也是不虚此行了吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1159.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"0fec8da2ee575568f6299593621cf23968f2011537e7e746d5f50c7adfaade9c","ja":"うん……そうだね～……。","zh":"嗯……也是呢～……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1159.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"2bd7b1fff1dfc53ae083300102446745798b3eb7717527cb9f6146fdacd5e372","ja":"あ、亜美ちゃん……？\nなんだか、元気がないみたいだけど……どうしたの？","zh":"啊、小亚美……？\n总觉得好像没什么精神的样子……怎么了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1159.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"2322a5ca928a29a54d2e08a88abc05586e732b2046b4491352601e8489d8ef98","ja":"だって、だって……。","zh":"可是，可是……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1159.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"307a2151b4233844c4f41afda79126b09df5499efc6cc1080e1fa5a63da49611","ja":"亜美はね……改めて打ちのめされたんだよ！\nお姫ちんとしのみやんのナイスなバディにっ！","zh":"亚美我啊……可是重新大受打击了呢！\n被贵音公主和小可怜的美妙身材给狠狠震撼到了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1159.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"7ff25585f96fa2a1c7cf34345a09741e15289a2752c0a55f1197518b113c269c","ja":"えっ……ええ～っ！？","zh":"咦……诶——！？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1159.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"a96c88df2bfc8dbb109ba1ef77f9e550ff2785a081ca71700979a299ea57b464","ja":"うらやましすぎるよ～！\n亜美もふたりみたいなイケイケボディになりたいーっ！","zh":"太让人羡慕啦～！\n亚美也想拥有像你们俩那样火辣的身材——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1159.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"ce540d94652561164185b9d4204fc3b06edfcc57b5f236213ed092f8f35ac1b2","ja":"なるほど。先ほどの亜美の面妖な視線には、\nそのような理由があったのですね。","zh":"原来如此。刚才亚美那奇怪的视线，\n原来是有这样的原因啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1159.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"3868962b2c7dc34d9c60af027f393a16493534c2abb87638bdcc483e6968ca01","ja":"気になるに決まってんじゃん！　もーこうなったら、\n今日はここでお泊りするしかないっしょ！","zh":"肯定会很在意的吧！既然都这样了，\n今天就只有在这里留宿这一个选择了吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1159.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"9d0f0dfbb8549a11511d4d7aaa46a63419ae955c09d0b1a475ca897ad8880e74","ja":"そんで、亜美は川の字のセンターで寝ることで、\nナイスバディパワーもいただいちゃうのだ～！","zh":"然后，亚美要睡在三个人中间，\n顺便吸走魔鬼身材的力量～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1159.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"4fe2178351ede53a5fe2d9bb3929ac680d2ccc41ea9eb5ea444e2653668610d0","ja":"な、ナイスバディパワーって……？","zh":"好、好身材的力量是……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
